            <ArticleTitle>Assessment and management of patients with post-operative pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-55; quiz 58</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Effective pain management is essential in the post-operative period to ensure that patients do not experience unnecessary distress or suffering and to minimise potential complications. Post-operative pain management strategies should focus on combining pharmacological management and comfort measures to ensure maximum pain relief for each patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
